	.string "Their report mentions strange sea\n"
	.string "temperatures. BIRCH should see it.\p"
	.string "Your journey keeps getting longer.\n"
	.string "Let's test both our teams again!$"

Route119_TYRival_BrendanBattleIntro::
	.string "BRENDAN: Since ROUTE 110,\n"
	.string "we've trained for this rematch!$"

Route119_TYRival_BrendanDefeat::
